        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Colonies: American proprietary colony, royal colony\n- People: John Cruger Jr.\n- Places: disputed border, northeast coast of North America\n- Events: skirmishes and raids between 1701 and 1765\n\nFacts:\n- Between 1701 and 1765, two American colonies had a series of skirmishes and raids along a disputed border.\n- John Cruger Jr. was the speaker for one of those colonies.\n- The colony for which John Cruger Jr. served as speaker was an American proprietary colony.\n- That American proprietary colony later became a royal colony on the northeast coast of North America.",
